WEBVTT

00:10.060 --> 00:12.830
Senior Cliff, this is Rudeus.

00:13.550 --> 00:16.520
Come in. It's not locked.

00:24.990 --> 00:26.440
Are you the only one here?

00:26.440 --> 00:27.660
Yes.

00:27.660 --> 00:30.680
Today, too, Cliff is preparing
for the wedding ceremony.

00:31.200 --> 00:34.120
Before we left for the Begaritt Continent,

00:34.120 --> 00:37.140
Cliff had proposed to Elinalise.

00:37.140 --> 00:38.140
That's right.

00:38.140 --> 00:40.270
They are going to get married.

00:40.780 --> 00:43.570
Regardless,
congratulations on your marriage.

00:45.160 --> 00:47.330
Are you unsatisfied with something?

00:47.330 --> 00:50.010
Cliff has been so busy lately.

00:50.010 --> 00:52.540
He's only able to do me
once every three days.

00:53.320 --> 00:57.390
Once you move into your love nest,
you won't go out for a week anyway.

00:58.340 --> 01:00.770
I'm jealous of you, Rudeus.

01:00.770 --> 01:04.160
You get to do it with both
Sylphie and Roxy at once.

01:04.160 --> 01:07.670
No, no, no!
We still haven't done threesomes!

01:07.670 --> 01:10.370
Really?
You haven't done it yet?

01:10.370 --> 01:13.830
Doing it with many people at once
is great, I assure you.

01:13.830 --> 01:16.010
Why don't you try it for once?

01:17.550 --> 01:20.540
Oh no!
This devil's tempting me!

01:20.540 --> 01:24.900
Don't you dare do it,
or you'll risk our marriages!

01:25.360 --> 01:26.910
Don't listen to her, Rudeus!

01:26.910 --> 01:28.330
Begone, Mara!

01:28.330 --> 01:29.530
You know...

01:29.530 --> 01:33.950
I can lay the groundwork by speaking
to them about it if you want.

01:33.950 --> 01:36.450
I beg you, O Great Elinalise!

01:36.450 --> 01:41.290
Oh my, but I'm not getting
anything out of this.

01:43.190 --> 01:47.620
Is there anything I can do for you?

01:47.620 --> 01:52.300
I remember hearing about a rare aphrodisiac
from the Kingdom of Asura.

01:52.300 --> 01:55.390
Do you even need to use
that kind of thing?

01:55.390 --> 02:00.100
I want to turn Cliff into a beast
on our first day of marriage.

02:01.900 --> 02:05.350
I understand.
I'll try my best to obtain it.

02:06.470 --> 02:10.320
When I'm imagining Cliff lost all
his restraint because of an aphrodisiac...

02:23.310 --> 02:26.420
The groom, Cliff Grimoire,

02:26.420 --> 02:31.360
do you swear to love only
Elinalise Dragonroad for your whole life?

02:31.360 --> 02:34.630
I swear to love only her
until my death.

02:34.890 --> 02:38.110
The bride, Elinalise Dragonroad,

02:38.110 --> 02:42.510
do you swear to love only
Cliff Grimoire for your whole life?

02:42.510 --> 02:46.470
I swear to love
only him all my life.

02:48.770 --> 02:53.320
In that case, the groom may place
the Necklace of Millis on his bride.

02:54.650 --> 02:56.760
Bend over a little, Lise.

02:56.760 --> 02:58.690
Oh my, I'm sorry.

03:02.270 --> 03:05.640
And now, the bride may give her groom
the kiss of vows.

03:05.640 --> 03:06.680
Yes.

03:18.680 --> 03:19.850
O God!

03:19.850 --> 03:25.710
Grant these two the everlasting
love and happiness!

03:33.110 --> 03:38.990
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

03:41.490 --> 03:43.070
That was amazing!

03:43.070 --> 03:45.690
Mrs. Elinalise looked so beautiful.

03:45.690 --> 03:47.540
I want to wear a dress like that.

03:47.850 --> 03:51.930
I guess girls do dream about
that sort of thing, huh?

03:51.930 --> 03:53.340
Well, yeah.

03:53.340 --> 03:58.150
But, when we did our wedding ceremony,
it was nice and warm in its own way.

03:58.150 --> 03:59.310
You're right.

04:06.930 --> 04:09.750
Roxy, do you want to have
a wedding ceremony, too?

04:09.750 --> 04:11.020
Well...

04:11.410 --> 04:14.650
The Migurd tribe has no tradition
of having ceremonies like that.

04:14.650 --> 04:17.029
We didn't do it, but..

04:17.399 --> 04:22.410
I wonder if she'd come to desire it
after seeing that ceremony.

04:22.410 --> 04:25.090
I don't need a ceremony, but...

04:25.090 --> 04:27.640
Come on, read the clue, will you?

04:38.310 --> 04:41.260
My apologies, your forehead's
looking so adorable.

04:41.260 --> 04:43.530
I-Is that so?

04:44.590 --> 04:47.180
Rudy, give me one too.

04:52.590 --> 04:57.900
Brother, please stop doing that
kind of thing in a public place.

04:57.900 --> 04:59.920
It can't be helped.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.570
What?! Hey!

05:01.570 --> 05:03.650
Please stop it!

05:07.160 --> 05:08.630
You're unbelievable!

05:08.630 --> 05:11.670
Why don't you have
any sense of shame?

05:11.670 --> 05:12.670
Aisha!

05:14.130 --> 05:15.750
Big Brother!

05:18.340 --> 05:21.770
Aisha, don't intertwine
your legs like that!

05:21.770 --> 05:22.970
Okay!

05:22.970 --> 05:24.450
Good grief.

05:24.450 --> 05:26.600
She is already eleven years old.

05:26.600 --> 05:29.650
I wish she showed ladylike behavior.

05:29.650 --> 05:32.230
It's okay, we're family after all.

05:32.650 --> 05:34.610
Wait, eleven years old?

05:34.610 --> 05:36.590
- I got a kiss from Big Brother!
- By any chance,

05:36.590 --> 05:37.210
- I got a kiss from Big Brother!
- they didn't get to celebrate

05:37.210 --> 05:37.990
- I'm not jealous at all!
- they didn't get to celebrate

05:37.990 --> 05:40.070
- I'm not jealous at all!
- their fifth and tenth birthdays?

05:40.400 --> 05:44.570
I'm sure Paul didn't have that kind of leisure
during the Teleportation Incident.

05:45.180 --> 05:49.040
When we get home,
we'll have to throw a big celebration.

05:49.720 --> 05:51.290
Okay, I decided.

05:51.960 --> 05:53.610
Let's have a party.

06:03.200 --> 06:06.410
As always, it's pretty lively
this time of year.

06:06.410 --> 06:07.810
You're right.

06:07.810 --> 06:10.310
There are always a lot of people
during the Harvest Festival.

06:10.700 --> 06:13.710
It's easy to find rare items
from outside the city.

06:13.710 --> 06:16.020
We'll be able to find some
great gifts for them.

06:16.020 --> 06:18.270
I'm sure both of them
will be surprised.

06:18.670 --> 06:21.580
I want to hold a surprise party
for my little sisters,

06:21.580 --> 06:24.830
so I asked Sylphie and Roxy to help me.

06:24.830 --> 06:29.540
But that wasn't the only reason
we went to the city today.

06:29.930 --> 06:32.870
I have already laid
the groundwork for you.

06:34.870 --> 06:36.160
Rudy?

06:36.550 --> 06:38.130
Rudy!

06:38.130 --> 06:39.360
Are you okay?

06:39.360 --> 06:41.230
You're drooling, you know.

06:41.230 --> 06:43.340
Are you hungry?

06:43.340 --> 06:46.850
Oh no, I let my imagination run wild.

06:46.850 --> 06:49.880
I have to choose the gifts
for Norn and Aisha properly.

06:49.880 --> 06:52.260
I want both of my wives
to enjoy this date, too.

06:52.260 --> 06:53.840
Both are important.

06:53.840 --> 06:57.390
I'm sorry.
I guess I was just lost in thought.

06:57.390 --> 06:59.230
Come on, let's go!

07:01.770 --> 07:05.940
This pot freezes whatever's in it
when you pump mana into it.

07:05.940 --> 07:08.160
It will be good for Aisha.

07:08.160 --> 07:11.850
I think Aisha might prefer cute things.

07:11.850 --> 07:13.480
Oh, you're right.

07:13.480 --> 07:17.120
By the way,
I wonder what Norn likes.

07:17.450 --> 07:20.130
Norn, huh?
I wonder about that myself too.

07:20.130 --> 07:25.380
Maybe armor, a sword, or a horse.
I think she likes boyish things.

07:25.710 --> 07:27.890
You seem to know her really well.

07:28.170 --> 07:31.760
I want to get along with her.

08:07.250 --> 08:10.470
I'm sorry.
You even picked out clothes for me.

08:10.470 --> 08:14.170
Don't worry.
It was fun for me too.

08:14.700 --> 08:16.520
Shall we have dinner now?

08:17.820 --> 08:20.750
Actually, I already reserved a place.

08:24.250 --> 08:25.900
This restaurant...

08:25.900 --> 08:28.400
Grandma told me about this place.

08:28.400 --> 08:30.280
If we have a fight,

08:30.280 --> 08:32.659
I need to bring you here
to make up, she said.

08:32.659 --> 08:35.240
Huh? You too, Sylphie?

08:35.240 --> 08:37.120
Elinalise said the same thing to me.

08:37.590 --> 08:42.380
She said Rudy might take
both of us here someday.

08:42.890 --> 08:47.040
So that's what this is all about?

08:49.040 --> 08:50.810
I see.

08:51.640 --> 08:53.820
Rudy is a pervert.

08:53.820 --> 08:56.170
No matter what anyone says,
I don't care.

08:56.170 --> 08:59.890
The Great Elinalise had done
her job perfectly.

08:59.890 --> 09:03.650
But I'm worried about Lucy
if we spend the night here.

09:03.650 --> 09:06.900
Don't worry, I've entrusted her
to Lilia for tonight.

09:06.900 --> 09:08.410
Even so...

09:08.410 --> 09:12.030
Well, if it's Mrs. Lilia,
I won't be that worried.

09:12.030 --> 09:15.130
She wanted to say it's wrong
for both parents to go out,

09:15.130 --> 09:17.150
leaving their child behind, right?

09:17.150 --> 09:18.910
I understand that.

09:18.910 --> 09:23.060
But... No, I won't make any excuses.

09:23.060 --> 09:27.380
Sorry, Lucy. Forgive this easily
tempted father of yours.

09:28.420 --> 09:30.710
All right then, you two...

09:30.710 --> 09:32.380
- Yes?
- What is it?

09:34.640 --> 09:36.230
Actually...

09:37.590 --> 09:40.410
I've reserved a room here.

09:40.410 --> 09:43.310
The line I wanted to say
at least once.

09:48.070 --> 09:51.650
Um, Roxy, let me ask you again.

09:51.650 --> 09:53.990
Are you okay doing this
together with me?

09:53.990 --> 09:56.790
Yes, I'm ready for this.

09:56.790 --> 09:58.690
I'm looking forward to it.

10:07.450 --> 10:10.650
This is going to be
a night to remember.

10:18.870 --> 10:21.730
Today is the day
of the surprise birthday party.

10:22.260 --> 10:24.570
There are various preparations
to be made,

10:24.570 --> 10:29.230
but in the meantime, I have to take
my two little sisters out of the house first.

10:47.280 --> 10:51.090
Ah, there you are!
Roxy, Norn, and Aisha.

10:51.090 --> 10:54.110
I need to talk to three of you.
Can you go out with me for a while?

10:54.110 --> 10:55.590
What do you want to talk about?

10:55.590 --> 10:58.300
Sure. Let's go!

10:58.300 --> 10:59.170
Huh?

10:59.170 --> 11:03.730
Master Rudeus invited you himself.
Aisha, you have to go with him.

11:14.760 --> 11:15.990
Fishing, huh?

11:15.990 --> 11:17.020
Yes.

11:17.020 --> 11:19.920
It's good for a bonding activity,
don't you think?

11:23.010 --> 11:26.450
Norn is still a bit awkward
around Roxy.

11:26.450 --> 11:28.880
Since Roxy said she wants
to get along with her,

11:29.270 --> 11:32.150
I hope they'll be able
to get closer with this.

11:35.720 --> 11:38.760
I've never gone fishing before.

11:38.760 --> 11:40.930
Me too!

11:40.930 --> 11:44.370
I always wanted to do it
at least once.

11:47.050 --> 11:50.930
Big Brother, let's have a contest
to see who can catch more fish!

11:50.930 --> 11:52.910
Sure, let's do it.

11:52.910 --> 11:56.710
Since we're at it, how about the loser
has to do whatever the winner says?

11:56.710 --> 11:57.740
I accept!

12:01.950 --> 12:04.910
Um, Brother?
How do I put this on properly?

12:06.650 --> 12:08.530
I don't know either.

12:08.530 --> 12:11.130
Because I've never gone fishing.

12:12.960 --> 12:14.240
Uhm...

12:17.310 --> 12:19.380
Would you like me to teach you?

12:21.860 --> 12:23.760
Yes, please.

12:25.770 --> 12:29.730
To avoid tearing the bait,
thread it onto the hook.

12:30.210 --> 12:34.810
Then, target the area near the trees
on the opposite bank from here.

12:34.810 --> 12:36.530
Do you think you can do it?

12:36.530 --> 12:38.070
I'll give it a try.

12:48.090 --> 12:49.650
That's good.

12:49.650 --> 12:51.670
Thank you very much.

12:55.710 --> 12:57.370
You're very good at this.

12:57.370 --> 13:03.350
Back when I was travelling alone,
I had to find my own food.

13:11.260 --> 13:12.560
Come to think of it,

13:12.560 --> 13:17.050
Ruijerd used to catch us lots of fish
when we were travelling together.

13:17.050 --> 13:18.330
Did he go fishing?

13:18.330 --> 13:22.020
No. He threw his spear into the water,

13:22.020 --> 13:24.800
and when he pulled it back,
he got three fish.

13:25.660 --> 13:28.330
Oh! Norn, you've got a bite!

13:28.330 --> 13:29.450
Huh?!

13:29.450 --> 13:30.600
Try to reel it in!

13:30.600 --> 13:31.210
Y-Yes!

13:33.640 --> 13:35.170
Oh, no!

13:36.160 --> 13:39.050
Good, that's how you do it.
Reel it in now!

13:39.050 --> 13:41.550
Keep it up, and do it carefully.

13:51.120 --> 13:54.770
I did it! I got a fish!
This is my first catch!

13:54.770 --> 13:57.360
Wow, you caught a big one!

13:58.180 --> 14:01.310
It seems it's just a matter of time
for both of them to get along.

14:01.310 --> 14:02.280
Yes!

14:02.830 --> 14:04.740
This makes three!

14:10.450 --> 14:14.170
Big Brother, you haven't caught
anything since earlier.

14:14.170 --> 14:15.990
Are you in bad shape or something?

14:15.990 --> 14:17.690
This shouldn't be happening.

14:17.690 --> 14:19.610
As the winner,
what shall I ask you to do?

14:19.610 --> 14:25.760
Maybe I'll make you hug me all night long
while whispering how cute I am?

14:26.200 --> 14:29.210
I don't mind doing that, but...

14:29.210 --> 14:30.250
No!

14:30.250 --> 14:34.020
I have to show my dignity
as big brother here.

14:35.230 --> 14:37.490
Fish!

14:38.150 --> 14:40.200
Yes! I caught a big...

14:42.780 --> 14:44.300
Big Brother...

14:44.300 --> 14:47.910
Well, cleaning the fishing spot
is also an angler's responsibility.

14:48.510 --> 14:51.160
Aisha, I will be serious now.

14:51.160 --> 14:53.470
So you weren't serious all this time?

14:53.470 --> 14:55.140
Well, just watch me.

15:02.610 --> 15:03.840
Isn't that...

15:03.840 --> 15:08.720
Ever since Roxy taught me Lightning,
I've been testing different approaches.

15:09.070 --> 15:11.890
The key to this spell lies in compression.

15:11.890 --> 15:14.810
By spreading a large amount of mana
into the sky to form a cloud,

15:14.810 --> 15:17.520
then by compressing it,
you can call down a bolt of lightning.

15:17.980 --> 15:20.940
But, if I can control the size
of the cloud from the start,

15:20.940 --> 15:24.230
I can weaken the output of the lightning.

15:24.870 --> 15:25.950
I named it...

15:26.720 --> 15:27.910
Electric!

15:38.020 --> 15:41.290
How's that?
Now it's my victory!

15:41.290 --> 15:43.650
Big Brother!
Using magic is not fair!

15:43.650 --> 15:44.840
Brother...

15:44.840 --> 15:47.760
Rudy, that's really childish of you.

15:53.720 --> 15:56.690
Look, look!
I caught this many.

15:56.690 --> 15:58.710
How many did you catch,
Big Sis Norn?

15:59.610 --> 16:03.400
I caught this big one thanks
to Sister Roxy's teaching.

16:05.970 --> 16:08.510
Big Sis Roxy,
please teach me next time, too!

16:08.510 --> 16:11.850
No! You already caught
way more than me.

16:11.850 --> 16:14.870
She will teach me next time.

16:15.320 --> 16:17.670
Come on, don't fight.

16:17.670 --> 16:19.950
I'll teach both of you.

16:21.240 --> 16:23.040
We're back!

16:26.110 --> 16:27.800
Happy birthday!

16:30.160 --> 16:32.180
Happy birthday!

16:32.560 --> 16:35.820
But we're already eleven years old?

16:35.820 --> 16:39.910
Yes, but we weren't able to celebrate
your tenth birthday for you.

16:39.910 --> 16:44.070
I know it's a bit late now, but Rudy
said a year late is not a big deal.

16:44.070 --> 16:45.870
Brother did?

16:45.870 --> 16:47.740
Come on, let's go in.

16:57.120 --> 17:00.290
Everyone, have you got
your drinks ready?

17:01.460 --> 17:04.480
It's been seven years since
the Fittoa Teleportation Incident.

17:04.480 --> 17:07.710
It took a long time, but our family
is finally back together.

17:08.530 --> 17:10.210
We lost our father.

17:10.210 --> 17:12.930
And I don't know
if Mom will get better or not.

17:13.310 --> 17:17.680
But if we spend all our time in grief,
Dad won't be happy.

17:18.400 --> 17:23.210
So I... No, we have to smile.

17:23.730 --> 17:26.220
When I met Dad
on the Begaritt Continent,

17:26.220 --> 17:29.690
we promised to have
a big celebration.

17:32.120 --> 17:36.070
Let's honor his memory by having
a good time tonight.

17:38.290 --> 17:39.580
Cheers, everyone!

17:39.580 --> 17:41.160
Cheers!

17:44.230 --> 17:48.300
These are gifts from Rudy and us
to both of you.

17:49.030 --> 17:51.380
I hope you like them.

17:52.010 --> 17:54.000
Thank you very much!

18:01.360 --> 18:03.080
Can I open it?

18:03.080 --> 18:04.560
Of course you can.

18:19.990 --> 18:21.530
Wow!

18:21.530 --> 18:24.420
Look, Big Sis Norn!
I got a pair of boots.

18:24.840 --> 18:28.170
Those are wonderful gifts
that you two received.

18:28.570 --> 18:31.300
Look, Mom!
I got this coat.

18:31.300 --> 18:34.510
I'm going to wear this when we
go out together next time, okay?

18:41.810 --> 18:43.990
Did she just smile?

18:46.910 --> 18:48.430
Mom...

18:57.480 --> 19:01.040
Madam... Thank goodness.

19:07.400 --> 19:10.880
These are from Madam and me.

19:10.880 --> 19:13.690
Thank you very much, Mrs. Lilia!

19:13.690 --> 19:17.590
Mom, is it okay for me
to have one too?

19:17.590 --> 19:20.050
Yes, of course.

19:20.050 --> 19:23.810
You're also Master Paul's daughter.

19:26.210 --> 19:28.940
Thank you, Mom.

19:31.930 --> 19:35.570
Madam, I'm looking forward to
serving you in the future.

19:46.410 --> 19:48.150
Thank you very much.

19:52.830 --> 19:54.140
Roxy.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.710
What is it?

19:59.710 --> 20:02.710
This one is from us for you, Roxy.

20:04.600 --> 20:06.530
For what?

20:06.530 --> 20:08.230
A wedding present.

20:08.230 --> 20:11.120
Roxy, congratulations on marrying Rudy.

20:11.120 --> 20:12.810
Huh?

20:12.810 --> 20:14.480
Go on, open it.

20:22.190 --> 20:23.530
This is...

20:23.990 --> 20:28.710
You remember when I said
that I got lucky with Rudy?

20:28.710 --> 20:29.870
Yes.

20:29.870 --> 20:37.150
If I hadn't met Rudy, I probably
wouldn't even be here today.

20:37.150 --> 20:38.890
That's a bit of an exaggeration.

20:38.890 --> 20:40.390
Of course not.

20:40.810 --> 20:44.260
My life changed completely
the day I met Rudy.

20:44.730 --> 20:49.370
That's why, when I see people like you,
who guided Rudy to the good path,

20:49.370 --> 20:52.270
and even love him,
it really makes me happy.

20:54.270 --> 21:01.710
But I don't really want him to reject you
just because of me, I guess?

21:01.710 --> 21:04.030
Sorry, I don't know how to put this.

21:06.390 --> 21:08.550
So I understand, Roxy.

21:09.500 --> 21:13.710
Let's be like Mrs. Zenith
and Mrs. Lilia, okay?

21:18.120 --> 21:20.930
Thank you so much.

21:23.470 --> 21:26.220
The whole family is smiling
and having a good time.

21:27.090 --> 21:31.120
This is probably the kind of scenery
that Paul wanted to see.

21:38.230 --> 21:39.230
Licky licky!

21:39.230 --> 21:41.740
Peek-a-boo!

21:41.740 --> 21:43.810
Aisha, your face is so funny!

21:46.930 --> 21:50.580
Rudy! Happy fifth birthday!

21:50.580 --> 21:52.350
I'm so glad for you, Lucy.

21:52.350 --> 21:56.420
Let's celebrate again
when they reach fifteen years old.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.470
Look! She's laughing.

21:59.470 --> 22:00.620
Lucy!

22:00.620 --> 22:01.970
So adorable!

22:01.970 --> 22:04.970
EPISODE 5
PARTY

23:34.980 --> 23:39.980
NEXT EPISODE
ANOTHER CRISIS?
